1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:08,060
Eighteen years ago tonight, a boat called the Mary Ellen went onto the rocks below this light.

2
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,830
The inquiry said her master was to blame.

3
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,400
The station log said the light was burning.

4
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:28,670
I know what the log said... I wrote it.

5
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:34,130
Tonight, the same gale. The same channel.

6
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:39,720
And someone out there is calling as the Mary Ellen.

7
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:04,020
By dawn, Stornoway will want my report.

8
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:08,480
One line in a book. That's all it ever was.
